{
    "_comment": "The scan editor's foot (EditorScanBottomPanel): what the scan being made is doing - recording, uploading, inserting, how it was placed - or how a scan made now would be placed; right after a scan, the readings' proposal of a better place on the earth for the map - how far it would move and turn it - with Apply and Not now (proposal-frame, hidden until there is one); a recording the service does not hold yet - Send later and Discard while it is sent, Send again and Discard when sending failed or stopped or an earlier run left one (held-frame); Scan here, which records one whether or not the device is localized, saying under its label the feature profile the scan is built with, with an arrow on its right opening the profile menu above it (profile-menu); Scans, the scans round the device with their pictures; Show map, the map over the camera while the device is localized - with a frame (map-frame) saying what of it: Landmarks (the localizer's points, the ones the latest fix matched in green), the scans' surfaces as Points or as the Mesh, and an opacity slider; Session, the localization recordings; Done, back to the editor's main page. Hidden until the scan editor opens. Sizes in UI points: 1000 across the screen.",
